  "ruleText": "Lot 7202.03 “Buy-in” means the amount of money or chips that a player needs to purchase to become involved in a poker game or tournament.\n\nSource. #12839, eff 7-27-19; ss by #14341, EMERGENCY, eff 8-21-25 (formerly Lot 7202.01); ss by #14503, eff 2-4-26, EXPIRES: 2-4-36 (formerly Lot 7202.02)",
